    "bodyText": "Log In\nSign Up\npuss_art_\n•\nFollow\nOriginal audio\npuss_art_\n \n25w\nMaybe time isn’t broken. Maybe it just doesn’t move the way we think. \n#animation #digitalart #darkart #surrealart #procreateanimation\nscarletwhispers_2004\n \n2d\n❤️❤️❤️\n1 like\nReply\nmysteries_of.reality\n \n1w\nJust discovered The Liminal Mind by Sam Salomon on Amazon! 🖤 If you want to recognize manipulation, understand hidden psychological patterns and stop being influenced without realizing it, this book is for you. Learn to see beyond the surface and protect yourself! 🖤💅🏼\nLike\nReply\nfragments.sun\n \n6w\nТак ощущаю те сны, которые вижу\n1 like\nReply\nsara_yousef_313\n \n6w\n🎬🖤\n1 like\nReply\npretty__jannatul\n \n7w\n😂😂😂\nLike\nReply\naltamas_legnd\n1 like\nReply\nslothofsleep\n \n8w\n🔥❤️\n1 like\nReply\nbadie2266\n \n9w\n🌱🌱🌱\n1 like\nReply\nsh_shuxratovich___\n \n9w\nSorry\nLike\nReply\ndhanushi_gihara_\n \n10w\nThat's single life\nLike\nReply\nariya_simran4\n \n10w\n😢😢\n1 like\nReply\nrah_____ta\nLike\nReply\n130.5K\n146\nJune 1\nLog in to like or comment.\nMore posts from puss_art_\nSee more posts\nMeta\nAbout\nBlog\nJobs\nHelp\nAPI\nPrivacy\nTerms\nLocations\nPopular\nInstagram Lite\nMeta AI\nMuse\nThreads\nContact Uploading & Non-Users\nMeta Verified\nEnglish\nAfrikaans\nالعربية\nČeština\nDansk\nDeutsch\nΕλληνικά\nEnglish\nEnglish (UK)\nEspañol (España)\nEspañol\nفارسی\nSuomi\nFrançais\nעברית\nBahasa Indonesia\nItaliano\n日本語\n한국어\nBahasa Melayu\nNorsk\nNederlands\nPolski\nPortuguês (Brasil)\nPortuguês (Portugal)\nРусский\nSvenska\nภาษาไทย\nFilipino\nTürkçe\n中文(简体)\n中文(台灣)\nবাংলা\nગુજરાતી\nहिन्दी\nHrvatski\nMagyar\nಕನ್ನಡ\nമലയാളം\nमराठी\nनेपाली\nਪੰਜਾਬੀ\nසිංහල\nSlovenčina\nதமிழ்\nతెలుగు\nاردو\nTiếng Việt\n中文(香港)\nБългарски\nFrançais (Canada)\nRomână\nСрпски\nУкраїнська\n© 2026 Instagram from Meta"
